  "notes": "Boxed section (BOX 2, blue frame is not a figure); box title (1) is the heading. Lines 5-9 are one display equation (private-use math glyphs, all visible) -> one 'other' paragraph. Lines 10-16 are variable definitions with '-' bullets; the GovDensity fraction (11,12,13: numerator/denominator pieces) is one item; line 14 (G_{j,t} definition, no bullet, indented) is a forced break and labeled its own list-item (could also be read as a continuation of 11-13). Table caption '[표] ...' (52, last in extraction order) is above the table, so it precedes the table in items. Table: ruled, header + 6 data rows (7 rows); finest grid is 6 cols because a narrow empty left column (x 90.5-110.5, vertical rule at x=110.5 starting at the 인공물 row) exists under the '정부 R&D 밀집도' row; '구분', '민간 특허 수(로그)', '정부 R&D 밀집도' span cols 0-1; the 4 sub-category labels sit in col 1; the empty merged cell (rows 3-6, col 0) is omitted from cells. Footer: line 0 ('56 ∙') ; the NABO logo image box at the page bottom (105,685,138,696) is a decorative logo, not labeled as a figure. review: no change. Column decision checked on a 432-dpi render: a ruled vertical line at x=110.5 runs from y=458.7 (top of the 인공물 row) to the table bottom, and the row rules at y=458.7/480.0/501.3/522.7 start at x=110.5 while the rules at y=395.3/416.2/437.3/544.0 run from the table edge x=90.5; so x=110.5 is a column boundary on the finest ruled grid (6 cols, 7 rows). The empty strip x 90.5-110.5 below 정부 R&D 밀집도 has no rule above it (it is the L-shaped remainder of that cell) and cannot be a rectangle together with it, so 정부 R&D 밀집도 stays at row 2 cols 0-1 and the empty strip (rows 3-6, col 0) is omitted from cells. Line 14 (unbulleted, indented G_{j,t} sub-definition under the GovDensity item) kept as its own list-item (nested entry, forced break).",
